{"unit_id":"tag:00WL:title","translation":"层（sheaves）的单射（Injective）与满射（surjective）映射（maps）","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"Injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"本节讨论的层"},{"source_term":"Injective","target_term":"单射","context":"标题中的单射映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"标题中的满射映射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"层之间的映射"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00WM:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为位点（site），并设 <MATH_0002> 为集合（sets）值层（sheaves）的映射（map）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 我们称 <MATH_0003> 是<TEXTITOPEN_0001>单射的（injective）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果对 <MATH_0004> 作为 <MATH_0005> 的每个对象（object），映射（map）<MATH_0006> 都是单射的（injective）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 我们称 <MATH_0007> 是<TEXTITOPEN_0002>满射的（surjective）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，如果对 <MATH_0008> 作为 <MATH_0009> 的每个对象（object），以及每个截面（section）<MATH_0010>，都存在覆盖（covering）<MATH_0011>，使得对所有 <MATH_0012>，限制（restriction）<MATH_0013> 都属于 <MATH_0014> 的像（image）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"层所在的位点"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"层的取值"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"给定映射的源和目标"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"层映射及其在对象上的分量"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的","context":"在每个对象上的取值为单射"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"位点中的对象"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的","context":"截面可沿覆盖局部提升"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面","context":"目标层中待局部提升的截面"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"局部提升所用的覆盖"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制","context":"给定截面在覆盖对象上的限制"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像","context":"源层截面的像"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00WN:statement","translation":"上面定义的单射（injective）（相应地，<SPACE_0001>满射（surjective））映射（maps），恰好是范畴的单态射（monomorphisms）（相应地，<SPACE_0002>满态射（epimorphisms）），所指的范畴（category）是 <MATH_0001>。层（sheaves）的映射（map）是同构（isomorphism），当且仅当它既是单射的（injective），又是满射的（surjective）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"monomorphisms","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"epimorphisms","target_term":"满态射"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射","context":"前定义中的单射映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"前定义中的满射映射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"层之间的映射"},{"source_term":"monomorphisms","target_term":"单态射","context":"层范畴中的单态射"},{"source_term":"epimorphisms","target_term":"满态射","context":"层范畴中的满态射"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"层范畴"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"同构判据中的层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"同构判据中的层映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"既单又满的层映射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的","context":"同构判据的单射条件"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的","context":"同构判据的满射条件"}],"notes":[]}
