{"unit_id":"tag:086K:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为位点（site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为集合（sets）值层（sheaves）的满射（surjection）。则图表（diagram）\n<MATH_0003>\n将 <MATH_0004> 表示为余等化子（coequalizer）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表"},{"source_term":"coequalizer","target_term":"余等化子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"给定层所在的位点"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"层的取值"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"满射的源和目标"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射","context":"给定的层满射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表","context":"核对给出的余等化图表"},{"source_term":"coequalizer","target_term":"余等化子","context":"层满射的余等化表示"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:086K:proof","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为集合（sets）值层（sheaf），并设 <MATH_0002> 为层（sheaves）的映射（map），使两个映射（maps）<MATH_0003> 的复合相等。设 <MATH_0004> 为映射（map）<MATH_0005> 的预层（presheaf）像（image）。由于积（product）<MATH_0006> 可以在预层（presheaves）范畴（category）中计算，可知它等于预层（presheaf）积（product）<MATH_0007>。因此，<MATH_0008> 诱导唯一的预层（presheaves）映射（map）<MATH_0009>。由于 <MATH_0010> 是 <MATH_0011> 的层化（sheafification），见引理 <REF_0001>，可得 <MATH_0012> 唯一地延拓为层（sheaves）的映射（map）<MATH_0013>。我们省略验证 <MATH_0014> 等于 <MATH_0015> 与给定映射（map）的复合（composition）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"积"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"积"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"目标层的取值"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"检验余等化泛性质的任意层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"给定映射及其延拓"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"从源层到测试层的映射及其分解"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"纤维积的两个投影"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"预层像及预层中的积"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像","context":"给定满射的预层像"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"积","context":"核对的纤维积"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"先在预层范畴内求得分解"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"预层范畴"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化","context":"目标层是预层像的层化"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"分解映射与给定映射的复合"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00WO:title","translation":"可表的（Representable）层（sheaves）","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Representable","target_term":"可表的"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Representable","target_term":"可表的","context":"本节标题中的可表性"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"本节讨论的层"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00WO:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为范畴（category）。典范（canonical）拓扑（topology）是使所有可表的（representable）预层（presheaves）都是层（sheaves）的最细（finest）拓扑（topology）（正式定义见定义 <REF_0001>，但我们不需要用到这个定义）。这个拓扑（topology）并不总是 <MATH_0002> 上某个位点（site）结构的相伴拓扑（topology）。我们将在 <MATH_0003> 具有纤维（fibered）积（products）的情形，给出生成该拓扑（topology）的一组覆盖（coverings）。首先给出如下的一般定义。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"finest","target_term":"最细"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"fibered","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"products","target_term":"积"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"典范拓扑所在的范畴"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范","context":"典范拓扑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"使所有可表预层成为层的最细拓扑"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的","context":"由对象表示的预层"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"用于定义典范拓扑的可表预层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"典范拓扑下的层"},{"source_term":"finest","target_term":"最细","context":"满足所述性质的拓扑中的最细者"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"位点结构可能不能给出该拓扑"},{"source_term":"fibered","target_term":"纤维","context":"纤维积的英文修饰语"},{"source_term":"products","target_term":"积","context":"原文写作fibered products"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"生成典范拓扑的一组覆盖"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00WP:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为范畴（category）。我们称族（family）<MATH_0002> 为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>有效满态射（effective epimorphism）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果所有态射（morphisms）<MATH_0003> 都是可表的（representable）（见范畴（Categories）定义 <REF_0001>），并且对任意 <MATH_0004>，序列\n<MATH_0005>\n是等化子（equalizer）图表（diagram）。我们称族（family）<MATH_0006> 为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>普遍有效满态射（universal effective epimorphism）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，如果对任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>，基变换（base change）<MATH_0008> 都是有效满态射（effective epimorphism）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"effective epimorphism","target_term":"有效满态射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"universal effective epimorphism","target_term":"普遍有效满态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"effective epimorphism","target_term":"有效满态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"所给族所在的范畴"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"具有共同目标的一族态射"},{"source_term":"effective epimorphism","target_term":"有效满态射","context":"可表态射族满足所列等化子条件"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"族的各个态射"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的","context":"保证相关纤维积存在"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用范畴章的定义"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子","context":"该族应满足的泛性质"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表","context":"态射集合构成的等化图表"},{"source_term":"universal effective epimorphism","target_term":"普遍有效满态射","context":"任意基变换后仍为有效满态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"任意基变换所沿的态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"所给态射族的拉回"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00WO:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n所有作为普遍（universal）有效（effective）满态射（epimorphisms）的族（families）所成的类（class），满足定义 <REF_0001> 的公理。如果 <MATH_0001> 具有纤维积（fibre products），则相伴拓扑（topology）就是典范（canonical）拓扑（topology）。（在这种情况下，为得到位点（site），可如集合论（Sets）引理 <REF_0002> 中那样论证。）\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n反之，假设 <MATH_0002> 是位点（site），并且所有可表的（representable）预层（presheaves）都是层（sheaves）。那么显然，所有覆盖（coverings）都是普遍（universal）有效（effective）满态射（epimorphisms）。因此，在位点（sites）的语境中，下面的定义是“正确”的定义。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"universal","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效"},{"source_term":"epimorphisms","target_term":"满态射"},{"source_term":"families","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合论"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"universal","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效"},{"source_term":"epimorphisms","target_term":"满态射"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"universal","target_term":"普遍","context":"任意基变换后的有效性"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效","context":"满足有效满态射的等化子条件"},{"source_term":"epimorphisms","target_term":"满态射","context":"普遍有效满态射族"},{"source_term":"families","target_term":"族","context":"所讨论的态射族"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类","context":"这些态射族构成的类"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"保证生成拓扑为典范拓扑的条件"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"相伴拓扑与典范拓扑"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范","context":"典范拓扑"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"由适当覆盖集合给出的结构"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合论","context":"引用集合论中的覆盖选取引理"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的","context":"可表预层"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"由对象表示的预层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"可表预层也是层"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"满足普遍有效性条件的覆盖"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"下面定义适用的位点语境"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00WQ:statement","translation":"我们称位点（site）<MATH_0001> 上的拓扑（topology）<TEXTITOPEN_0001>弱于典范拓扑（weaker than the canonical topology）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，或称该拓扑（topology）是<TEXTITOPEN_0002>子典范的（subcanonical）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，如果 <MATH_0002> 的所有覆盖（coverings）都是普遍（universal）有效（effective）满态射（epimorphisms）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"weaker than the canonical topology","target_term":"弱于典范拓扑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"subcanonical","target_term":"子典范的"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"universal","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效"},{"source_term":"epimorphisms","target_term":"满态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"给定的位点"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"位点的相伴拓扑"},{"source_term":"weaker than the canonical topology","target_term":"弱于典范拓扑","context":"强调区域中定义的拓扑比较条件"},{"source_term":"subcanonical","target_term":"子典范的","context":"所有可表预层为层的拓扑"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"定义中的全部覆盖"},{"source_term":"universal","target_term":"普遍","context":"覆盖基变换后的条件"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效","context":"有效满态射条件"},{"source_term":"epimorphisms","target_term":"满态射","context":"定义所要求的覆盖性质"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00WO:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n可表的（representable）层（sheaf）是一个同时为层（sheaf）的可表（representable）预层（presheaf）。在拓扑（topology）不是子典范的（subcanonical）时，或许最好避免使用这一术语，所以我们只在子典范的情形正式定义它。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"subcanonical","target_term":"子典范的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的","context":"作为可表层的可表性"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"可表预层同时满足层条件"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"由对象表示的预层"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"可表层所对应的预层"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"使用可表层术语的拓扑条件"},{"source_term":"subcanonical","target_term":"子典范的","context":"仅在子典范情形正式定义该术语"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00WR:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为位点（site），其拓扑（topology）是子典范的（subcanonical）。米田嵌入（Yoneda embedding）<MATH_0002>（见范畴（Categories）第 <REF_0001> 节）将 <MATH_0003> 表示为层（sheaves）范畴（category）的完全子范畴（full subcategory），这些层定义于 <MATH_0004> 上。在这种情况下，我们将形如 <MATH_0005> 且满足 <MATH_0006> 的层（sheaves），称为 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>可表层（representable sheaves）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，位于 <MATH_0007> 上。记号：有时，将可表的（representable）层（sheaf）<MATH_0008>（与 <MATH_0009> 相伴）记为 <TEXTITOPEN_0002><MATH_0010><TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"subcanonical","target_term":"子典范的"},{"source_term":"Yoneda embedding","target_term":"米田嵌入"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"完全子范畴"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"representable sheaves","target_term":"可表层"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"具有子典范拓扑的位点"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"位点的拓扑"},{"source_term":"subcanonical","target_term":"子典范的","context":"可表预层均为层"},{"source_term":"Yoneda embedding","target_term":"米田嵌入","context":"把底范畴嵌入层范畴的函子"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用范畴章"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"底位点上的层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"层范畴"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"完全子范畴","context":"底范畴在层范畴中的像"},{"source_term":"representable sheaves","target_term":"可表层","context":"强调区域中命名的层"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的","context":"记号说明中的可表性"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"与给定对象相伴的可表层"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00WO:prose-0004","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，在该定义的情形下，对每个层（sheaf）都有\n<MATH_0001>，\n其中所指的层为 <MATH_0002>，因为这对预层（presheaves）成立，见 (<REF_0001>)。一般而言，预层（presheaves）<MATH_0003> 并不是层（sheaves）；为了得到层（sheaf），必须将其层化（sheafify）。此时仍有\n<MATH_0004>\n对每个层（sheaf）<MATH_0005> 成立。具体而言，第一个等式由 <MATH_0006> 的伴随性（adjointness）得到，第二个等式就是 (<REF_0002>)。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheafify","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"adjointness","target_term":"伴随性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"米田型公式的目标层"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"原米田公式及可能并非层的可表预层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"可表预层一般未必满足的层条件"},{"source_term":"sheafify","target_term":"层化","context":"将可表预层转为层"},{"source_term":"adjointness","target_term":"伴随性","context":"层化的伴随泛性质"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00WT:statement","translation":"<LOCKED_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为位点（site）。如果 <MATH_0002> 是位点（site）<MATH_0003> 的覆盖（covering），那么集合值预层（presheaves of sets）的态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0004>\n在层化（sheafification）后成为满射的（surjective）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"presheaves of sets","target_term":"集合值预层"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"给定覆盖所在的位点"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"给定的一族覆盖态射"},{"source_term":"presheaves of sets","target_term":"集合值预层","context":"可表预层余积到目标可表预层"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"覆盖诱导的预层态射"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化","context":"对该预层态射作层化"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的","context":"层化后所得的满射"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00WT:proof","translation":"由上面的引理 <REF_0001>，只需说明\n<MATH_0001>\n是满态射（epimorphism）。设 <MATH_0002> 为集合（sets）值层（sheaf）。态射（morphism）<MATH_0003> 对应于截面（section）<MATH_0004>。因此，<MATH_0005> 的单射性（injectivity）直接由 <MATH_0006> 的层性质（sheaf property）得到。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"epimorphism","target_term":"满态射"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"injectivity","target_term":"单射性"},{"source_term":"sheaf property","target_term":"层性质"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"epimorphism","target_term":"满态射","context":"证明层化后的覆盖态射为满态射"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"测试层的取值"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"任意测试层"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"从层化可表预层到测试层的态射"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面","context":"由米田公式对应的截面"},{"source_term":"injectivity","target_term":"单射性","context":"检验满态射所需的单射性"},{"source_term":"sheaf property","target_term":"层性质","context":"相容截面的唯一性"}],"notes":[]}
